@host = http://localhost:5216

### 1. Registrar usuario (devuelve accessToken)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Breinner", "email": "breinner@example.com", "password": "Clave12345" }

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "breinner@example.com", "password": "Clave12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3. Crear planta
POST {{host}}/plantas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Monstera", "especie": "Monstera deliciosa", "ubicacion": "Sala", "fotoUrl": null }

### 4. Listar plantas
GET {{host}}/plantas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Detalle de planta
GET {{host}}/plantas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Editar planta
PUT {{host}}/plantas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Monstera grande", "especie": "Monstera deliciosa", "ubicacion": "Balcón", "fotoUrl": null }

### 7. Agregar cuidado (tipo: riego | fertilizacion | poda | rotacion | trasplante | revision_plagas)
POST {{host}}/plantas/1/cuidados
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tipo": "riego", "frecuenciaDias": 1 }

### 8. Marcar cuidado como realizado
PUT {{host}}/cuidados/1/completar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Cuidados pendientes
GET {{host}}/pendientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Eliminar planta
DELETE {{host}}/plantas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
